        =\kappa _{I}^{2}+O\left(\e{-S}\right).
\end{equation*}
Consequently, as $S\rightarrow\infty$, the operation `$.\,\wedge\, \omega ^{2}$' annihilates all components of the $
1-$form $\func{tr}\left( \tau .\bar{\partial}\sigma +\partial _{H}\tau
