           \label{lemma parabola} 
For each $t>0$, the transversal supremum $\ell_t$ is bounded below over $I_t$ by the concave parabola $P_t(s-S_t):= L_t -\frac{\beta}{2}(s-S_t)(s-S_t+1)$, i.e.,
