        -\vert \hat{F}\vert ^{2}\right) \omega ^{3}.
\end{equation*}
Comparing we find $\left\vert F\right\vert ^{2}\omega ^{3}=\func{tr}F^{2}\wedge \omega +2\vert \hat{F}\vert ^{2}\omega ^{3}$ [cf. \emph{Subsection \ref{Sub energy bounds}}], so
